  "scope": "Exact bytes from the mode plus the 21 direct zero-based payload offsets where i % 3 != 0. All accepted complete DUs are included. No clock or same-position restriction is imposed on lookup. A matched occurrence pair is counted for each left and right observation sharing the signature. Run coordinates are [source index in its side's list, native MSC row, slot within DU], all zero-based. Runs continue within a DU or across adjacent, complete 0/1/2/0 native rows with endpoint counters differing by one. Gaps and file boundaries end runs. Stride 1 counts 20 ms words; stride 4 follows each role in successive quartets. Both run endpoints in examples are inclusive.",
